I think this is another thing we should think about. It would be very helpful to be able to edit the token's royalty attributes in a safe way if the policy is unlocked.

If the creator/original wallet still has ownership of the token, why should they not be able to change the royalty attributes?
Ex Burn my NFT and remint with new royalty metadata. 

